{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>日本神奈川縣三車相撞，造成1死、13傷。</p><p></p><p>事發在神奈川縣藤澤市，當地周一上午九時許，警方接報稱，藤澤市一個路口有巴士、的士和一輛私家車相撞。</p><p></p><p>當地傳媒報道，涉事的私家車由一名長者駕駛，途中失控擦撞多輛汽車，再直衝十字路口撞上巴士，警方正在調查事故起因。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T14:22:18.720982+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T14:02:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T17:24:09.783788+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T14:18:17.850476+00:00","content_hash":"e3f6cf485adc347c04926ece953253dfbd33bda58e3dac4e75b065a4d22c8ef2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}